These modifications add:
  - A max quality track (--quality max): cubic-bezier tracing via img2bez
    into a UFO source, compiled to OTF (CFF) via fonttools. Smoother organic
    curves than the base potrace/svg2ttf/TTF path.
  - The "live font": authentic handwriting variation via a GSUB calt feature
    that cycles real redrawn glyph variants, so repeated letters differ.
  - Auto-labeling via the Hungarian algorithm, ligature (liga) generation,
    reference-free glyph quality scoring (qc), and UPM-consistent metrics.

